msgstr "BMC Redfish: %s"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Host name or IP address of the BMC, without https:// or a path."
msgstr "Orúkọ olùgbàlejò tàbí àdírẹ́sì IP ti BMC náà, láìsí https:// tàbí ọ̀nà."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Do not verify is logged when set and shown as a warning on the health page while it stays."
msgstr "A máa ń kọ 'Má ṣe fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀' sínú àkọsílẹ̀ nígbà tí a bá yàn án, a sì máa ń fi hàn gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìkìlọ̀ lórí ojú-ewé ìlera níwọ̀n ìgbà tí ó bá wà bẹ́ẹ̀."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "CA Bundle File"
msgstr "Fáìlì Àkójọpọ̀ CA"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Fún ìlànà àkójọpọ̀ CA: ọ̀nà kíkún lórí poller sí fáìlì PEM tí àwọn ẹlòmíràn kò lè kọ sí."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Fún ìlànà tí a dènà: SHA-256 base64 ti kọ́kọ́rọ́ gbangba BMC náà, gẹ́gẹ́ bí sha256//... tàbí hàṣì lásán. Kọ́kọ́rọ́ tí ó yí padà yóò kùnà títí a óò fi ṣe àtúnṣe èyí."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Public Key Pin"
msgstr "Ìdènà Kọ́kọ́rọ́ Gbangba"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Allow Basic Authentication Fallback"
msgstr "Gba Ìpadàsẹ́yìn Ìfìdí-òdodo Basic Láàyè"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Used only when the BMC offers no session service. Every request then carries the password; the health page warns while it is in use."
msgstr "A máa ń lò ó nìkan nígbà tí BMC kò bá pèsè iṣẹ́ ìgbà ìjókòó. Gbogbo ìbéèrè yóò máa gbé ọ̀rọ̀-ìpamọ́ rìn nígbà náà; ojú-ewé ìlera yóò máa kìlọ̀ níwọ̀n ìgbà tí ó bá wà ní lílò."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "The Cacti device of the server this BMC manages. Leave it at none to have the plugin create a device from the list."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ Cacti ti olùpèsè tí BMC yìí ń ṣàkóso. Fi sí kò sí kí àfikún náà lè ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ kan láti inú àtòjọ náà."

