#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: uses Basic authentication because the BMC offers no session service; every request carries the password."
msgstr "%s: ń lo ìfìdí-òdodo Basic nítorí pé BMC kò pèsè iṣẹ́ ìgbà ìjókòó; gbogbo ìbéèrè ni ó ń gbé ọ̀rọ̀-ìpamọ́ rìn."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: a session may have been left open on the BMC; the next run deletes it after logging in."
msgstr "%s: ìgbà ìjókòó kan lè ti wà ní ṣíṣí sílẹ̀ lórí BMC náà; ìṣiṣẹ́ tó ń bọ̀ yóò pa á rẹ́ lẹ́yìn ìwọlé."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: %d session logins in a row lost their response, so logins stopped. Check the BMC session list, then use Retry Now."
msgstr "%s: ìwọlé ìgbà ìjókòó %d ní ìtẹ̀léra pàdánù ìdáhùn wọn, nítorí náà àwọn ìwọlé dáwọ́ dúró. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àtòjọ ìgbà ìjókòó BMC, lẹ́yìn náà lo Gbìyànjú Lẹ́ẹ̀kan Sí i Nísinsìnyí."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the BMC rejected the credential. It is not tried again until the credential changes."
msgstr "%s: BMC náà kọ ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé náà. A kò ní gbìyànjú rẹ̀ mọ́ títí tí ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé yóò fi yí padà."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its credential is missing or has no stored password."
