#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Àpótí Ìpamọ́ Ìwé-ẹ̀rí"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Fáìlì Kọ́kọ́rọ́ Àpótí Ìpamọ́"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà kíkún sí kọ́kọ́rọ́ 32-byte tí ó ń ṣàṣírí àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìpamọ́ BMC tí a fi pamọ́. Ṣẹ̀dá rẹ̀ fúnra rẹ, níta gbòǹgbò wẹ́ẹ̀bù, tí olùpèsè wẹ́ẹ̀bù àti olùmúlò poller nìkan lè kà, nínú àkójọpọ̀ fáìlì tí root àti olùmúlò náà nìkan lè kọ sí; àfikún náà kì í ṣẹ̀dá tàbí kọ ọ́ láéláé. Ṣe àfipamọ́ rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú ibi ìpamọ́ dátà: láìsí rẹ̀, a gbọ́dọ̀ tún àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìpamọ́ tí a fi pamọ́ tẹ̀ sínú."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Olùkójọpọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Àlàfo Àkókò Ìkójọpọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láàárín kíkà BMC kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Àlàfo Àtúnṣàwárí"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láàárín àwọn àwárí ohun-ìní kíkún ti BMC kọ̀ọ̀kan. A tún máa ń ṣe àtúnṣàwárí BMC lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ nígbà tí ohun-ìní tí a mọ̀ bá pòórá tàbí yí irú rẹ̀ padà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Ìṣirò Àkókò Olùkójọpọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ìṣiṣẹ́ olùkójọ kan lè lò kí ó tó dáwọ́ dúró láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ àwọn BMC tuntun. Jẹ́ kí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ àlàfo poller; àwọn BMC tí kò parí yóò tẹ̀síwájú ní ìṣiṣẹ́ tó ń bọ̀."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "Àwọn BMC tí a ń kà ní ìbámu lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà. Òṣìṣẹ́ kan ní ìgbà kan ni ó ń ka BMC kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Àwọn Òṣìṣẹ́ Olùkójọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró Ìsopọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí a gbà láàyè fún ìsopọ̀ TCP àti ìbáṣepọ̀ ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ TLS sí BMC kan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìparí Ìbéèrè"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí a gbà láàyè fún odidi ìbéèrè kan sí BMC kan, títí kan ìsopọ̀ náà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB tí a gbà wọlé nínú ara ìdáhùn BMC kan; ìdáhùn tí ó tóbi jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ ni a máa kọ̀."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Ìdáhùn Púpọ̀ Jùlọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Ìtuntun"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Àwọn àlàfo ìkójọ lẹ́yìn èyí tí kíkà yóò fi hàn gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí ó pẹ́."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Ó Pẹ́ Lẹ́yìn"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Àwọn àlàfo ìkójọ lẹ́yìn èyí tí kíkà ti kọjá àkókò tí ó sì ń kà bí àìmọ̀. Máa jẹ́ o kéré jù ọ̀kan ju Ó Pẹ́ Lẹ́yìn lọ nígbà gbogbo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Di Àtijọ́ Lẹ́yìn"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Yọ kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Pa Àwọn Tábìlì Àfikún Mọ́ Nígbà Yíyọ Kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́ sí i, yíyọ àfikún náà kúrò yóò pa àkọsílẹ̀ ìforúkọsílẹ̀ BMC rẹ̀, àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìpamọ́ oníṣàṣírí, àti ibi ìpamọ́ kíkà mọ́. Yọ àmì rẹ̀ kúrò kí yíyọ-kúrò lè pa wọ́n rẹ́. Yíyọ-kúrò kì í fọwọ́ kan àwọn ẹ̀rọ Cacti, àwòrán-ìṣirò, tàbí BMC láéláé, títí kan àwọn ẹ̀rọ tí àfikún náà ṣẹ̀dá."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀ lòdì sí ibi ìpamọ́ CA ti ètò"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀ lòdì sí fáìlì àkójọpọ̀ CA kan"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Kọ́kọ́rọ́ gbangba tí a dènà (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Má ṣe fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀ (kò láàbò)"

